OL,3,GNEWSACounty Down man among three jailed
OL,4,Afor planning mosque attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA County Down man is among three men
OL,7,Fwho have been jailed for attempting to
OL,8,Fengage in a terrorist activity,
OL,9,Fspecifically damaging a mosque in
OL,10,FGalway.
OL,12,FGarrett Pollock (36) of Kilhorne Greene
OL,13,Fin Annalong was sentenced to 10 and a
OL,14,Fhalf years with the last year
OL,15,Fsuspended.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
