OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACounty Down man among three jailed
OL,4,Afor planning mosque attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FDarren Gorman (34) of O'Moore Place in
OL,7,FPortlaoise was sentenced to eight years
OL,8,Fwith the last year suspended and
OL,9,FKarolis Peckauskas (39) of Newfoundwell
OL,10,FRoad in Drogheda was sentenced to eight
OL,11,Fyears in prison with the last year
OL,12,Fsuspended.
OL,14,FThey had made advanced plans to blow up
OL,15,Fthe Maryam Mosque on the Monivea Road
OL,16,Fbetween 4 and 5 November 2025 when they
OL,17,Fwere arrested, the Special Criminal
OL,18,FCourt in Dublin heard.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
